   29|       |	 * (that is, a precompiled chunk). It may be the string "b" (only binary
   30|       |	 * chunks), "t" (only text chunks), or "bt" (both binary and text). The
   31|       |	 * default is "bt".
   32|       |	 * Lua runtime (at least PUC Rio Lua and LuaJIT) has bytecode and Lua
